.pytest_cache/

# Runtime state: sessions, audit trails, invitations, published versions.
# Authored question banks live in content/ and ARE checked in.
#
# Leading slash: anchors this to the repository root. A bare `data/` matches a
# directory named `data` at ANY depth, which silently excluded the whole
# `services/data/` package — the repository layer the app imports at startup —
# from the initial commit. An ignore rule for one specific directory has to say
# which one.
/data/
